{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on faded tiles in a place that feels wrong, with the tension of a space you don't recognize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover where you are and the reason of being here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 graphically distinct levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level introduces new game play mechanics and new secrets to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discovering the story without reading lines of text but through visual experiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great, atmospheric ambient soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liminal spaces inspired graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually clean and well-organized first-person experience like no other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In First you can't die</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenge of the game is to open the way forward by solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive and interesting puzzles keep you grounded in the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No jump scares or unnecessary stress. Each action opens a path to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the unknown and find out what lies beyond the first door.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4062490?t=1761494945","background_raw":"http